# spa3: sand_temple_dark (42b935e4) layer 10, as spa_sandtempledark.con up to the Increments (offline model
# set-up, mBackupModelData engaged: tools/cov/specs/spa3_force.py forces !IsMaxSpeed and holds the
# countdown), then both actors are deleted while the backup is still engaged (the destructor's live arm).
@f260 layer 10
@f300 god 1; give darkSuit 1; give lightSuit 1
@f320 obj e0024022f; obj e00240396
@f340 send e0024022f Activate
@f360 send e00240396 Activate
@f700 obj e0024022f
@f720 send e0024022f Increment
@f740 send e00240396 Increment
@f1000 send e0024022f Delete
@f1020 send e00240396 Delete
@f1200 obj e0024022f
